---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import profilePic from "@/assets/kusmayadi-avatar.png";
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
---

<Layout title="About Kusmayadi" description="A little bit about Kusmayadi">
    <section class="container mx-auto">
        <div class="card card-side w-full bg-base-300 mx-auto shadow-lg">
            <figure class="p-6 pr-0">
                <Picture
                    src={profilePic}
                    alt="Kusmayadi"
                    class="rounded-xl shadow-xl"
                    loading="eager"
                />
            </figure>
            <div class="card-body text-2xl">
                <p class="mb-5">
                    Hi, I'm Kusmayadi, a software engineer, lifelong learner,
                    and someone who genuinely enjoys building things that solve
                    real problems. I've been developing for more than 25 years,
                    with the last decade focused on Laravel and modern web
                    technologies. Over the years, I've worked on everything from
                    business applications and APIs to marketplaces and SaaS
                    platforms, always aiming to create software that is clean,
                    reliable, and built to last. I enjoy diving into complex
                    technical challenges, but I find just as much satisfaction
                    in simplifying them into solutions that make life easier for
                    users and development teams alike.
                </p>

                <p class="mb-5">
                    Outside of writing code, I'm always exploring new
                    technologies, refining my craft, and learning better ways to
                    build software. I enjoy sharing knowledge, mentoring other
                    developers, and collaborating with people who care about
                    quality as much as I do. When I'm away from the keyboard,
                    you'll probably find me listening to blues, grunge, or
                    electronic music, experimenting with guitar effects, or
                    tinkering with side projects just for the joy of learning. I
                    believe the best engineers stay curious, never stop
                    improving, and always leave the codebase a little better
                    than they found it.
                </p>

                <p class="mb-5">
                    Feel free to <a href="/get-in-touch" class="underline"
                        >contact me</a
                    > if you have the same interests, have some projects that need
                    some help, or just growing a network.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
